title Vinyl: an empty library (no music folder, no saved state): now playing with nothing, the browser's notice row, the empty queue, at the deck's own density (640x480, 11.3 px/mm) (allow-small: the rows under 7 mm are warnings)
sizes 640x480
# the deck's own density (11.3 px/mm, the harness's default for 640x480): the approved layout's touch rows are 70 px
# there, under the 7 mm (79 px): allow-small reports them as warnings (the owner's rule R-4) instead of failing
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_EMPTY 1
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE now

wait 1000
shot 01-now-empty
expect esc
expect text "Nothing playing"
expect text "Pick a folder"
expect text "or a playlist"
key esc
wait 300
shot 02-browser-empty
expect text "No music folder"
expect text "Copy music to ~/Music"
key q
wait 300
shot 03-queue-empty
expect text "EMPTY QUEUE"
key left
wait 300
key esc
expect quit
